{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2024-09", "window": 1, "start_date": 1725148800, "end_date": 1725753599, "month_true_total": 46, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:55:31 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "174434183", "author": {"steamid": "76561198053439954", "personaname": "I SAID: YOKO! IS! RIGHT!", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ggg_megalomancer/", "num_games_owned": 768, "num_reviews": 132, "playtime_forever": 4946, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4946, "last_played": 1711515845, "avatar": "4767253ecffaa849bd0537c00ea8b7e9574b17ca"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is the absolute stupidest video game I've ever enjoyed in my entire life, and I have practically nothing but praise for it. It goes on sale frequently and is absolutely worth the price. Just make sure you have people to play with; it's fine solo but the real fun comes from playing with friends.\n\nThe most important thing to remember is that you use the D-pad to issue voice commands and it is your solemn duty to sing the anthem of the Earth Defense Force whenever you have the opportunity, and to join with your comrades when they start singing.\n\nAlso that Fencer can jump cancel its dash and zoom across the battlefield with absurd speed.\n\nThis game is absolutely wonderful. I will spoil nothing. I recommend this game to everyone with joy in their heart and love for things that are stupid, awesome, hilarious, and hilariously stupidly awesome.", "timestamp_created": 1725710482, "timestamp_updated": 1725710482, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 23, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.734682321548461914", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 2}, {"reactio